        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luvarith</strong> rots on the edge of collapse. The forest whispers with hunger and the kingdom holds more secrets than it ever did kings. And beneath the ruins, something older still waits...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 2Deco role-playing game about scavengers, traitors, and survivors caught in a web of lies and forgotten history. Wander the blackened ruins of <strong>Vespera’s Cradle</strong>, slip through the shadowed halls of <strong>Orr-Sihm Castle</strong> and walk beneath the suffocating canopy of the <strong>Vardain Forest</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companions come and go - some stolen, some broken, some betraying you when the cost grows too steep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At <strong>Luvarith</strong>'s heart stands the <strong>Throne of Aether</strong>, a towering relic that refuses to die. It might hold the secrets of the four <strong>Keystones</strong> scattered across the land, bound by an empire long ago. But every fragment of truth carries a price, and some debts can only be paid in blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t a story about heroes. It’s a story about survival, sacrifice, and the shadows that bind us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838460/extras/92f68685f1fb03bddf690df739a1b3c5.avif?t=1781885421\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Key Features:</u></i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2Deco Visual Style</strong> – Classic pixel characters set against modern 3D backdrops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character-Driven Storytelling</strong> – Everyone carries secrets and weight, shaping the fate of your party and the empire itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration of Forgotten Realms</strong> – Explore the Argentum Scholarium, brave the Desert Colossus Challenge and descend into the Underway Passage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Companions</strong> – Scoundrels, scholars, exiles, and ghosts bound by secrets and betrayal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Mysteries</strong> – Recover ancient lore and unlock the sealed gates of whatever dies beneath the earth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unforgettable Music</strong> - Dive deep into the lore with majestic compositions and haunting melodies.</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Luvarith</strong> rots on the edge of collapse. The forest whispers with hunger and the kingdom holds more secrets than it ever did kings. And beneath the ruins, something older still waits...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a 2Deco role-playing game about scavengers, traitors, and survivors caught in a web of lies and forgotten history. Wander the blackened ruins of <strong>Vespera’s Cradle</strong>, slip through the shadowed halls of <strong>Orr-Sihm Castle</strong> and walk beneath the suffocating canopy of the <strong>Vardain Forest</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Companions come and go - some stolen, some broken, some betraying you when the cost grows too steep.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At <strong>Luvarith</strong>'s heart stands the <strong>Throne of Aether</strong>, a towering relic that refuses to die. It might hold the secrets of the four <strong>Keystones</strong> scattered across the land, bound by an empire long ago. But every fragment of truth carries a price, and some debts can only be paid in blood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn’t a story about heroes. It’s a story about survival, sacrifice, and the shadows that bind us.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3838460/extras/92f68685f1fb03bddf690df739a1b3c5.avif?t=1781885421\" width=1280 height=720 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i><u>Key Features:</u></i></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2Deco Visual Style</strong> – Classic pixel characters set against modern 3D backdrops.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Character-Driven Storytelling</strong> – Everyone carries secrets and weight, shaping the fate of your party and the empire itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Exploration of Forgotten Realms</strong> – Explore the Argentum Scholarium, brave the Desert Colossus Challenge and descend into the Underway Passage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Companions</strong> – Scoundrels, scholars, exiles, and ghosts bound by secrets and betrayal.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Ancient Mysteries</strong> – Recover ancient lore and unlock the sealed gates of whatever dies beneath the earth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unforgettable Music</strong> - Dive deep into the lore with majestic compositions and haunting melodies.</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "A story-rich 2Deco RPG where exiles, scavengers, and traitors are drawn together by fate. Explore crumbling ruins, haunted forests, and cursed castles as you uncover the empire’s forgotten truth. The past isn’t dead; it’s waiting.",
